    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "About the data.\n",
        "\n",
        "Our data consists of cells from 6 different individuals with varying BMI\n",
        "\n",
        "Hs09: sample from an individual with BMI of 45.7\n",
        "\n",
        "Hs12: sample from an individual with BMI of 48.8\n",
        "\n",
        "Hs13: sample from an individual with BMI of 43.2\n",
        "\n",
        "Hs254: sample from an individual with BMI of 23.96\n",
        "\n",
        "Hs255: sample from an individual with BMI of 24.27\n",
        "\n",
        "Hs266: sample from an individual with BMI of 22.15\n",
        "\n",
        "This data has been...\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Cleaned to ensure only high-quality, recognizable sequences are organized into the count matrix by CellRanger.\n",
        "\n",
        "2. Formatted into Seurat data type that allows our data to be further analyzed\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Ck3qKLfAkXxG"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#1-1. Loading practice data (< 1min)\n",
        "%%R\n",
        "setwd(\"/content/content/drive/MyDrive/R_libs\")\n",
        "hs09 <- readRDS(\"hs09.rds\")\n",
        "hs12 <- readRDS(\"hs12.rds\")\n",
        "hs13 <- readRDS(\"hs13.rds\")\n",
        "hs254 <- readRDS(\"hs254.rds\")\n",
        "hs255 <- readRDS(\"hs255.rds\")\n",
        "hs266 <- readRDS(\"hs266.rds\")\n",
        "\n",
        "#down sampling\n",
        "set.seed(42)\n",
        "\n",
        "cells_to_keep09 <- sample(colnames(hs09), size = 1000)\n",
        "hs09 <- subset(hs09, cells = cells_to_keep09)\n",
        "\n",
        "cells_to_keep12 <- sample(colnames(hs12), size = 1000)\n",
        "hs12 <- subset(hs12, cells = cells_to_keep12)\n",
        "\n",
        "cells_to_keep13 <- sample(colnames(hs13), size = 1000)\n",
        "hs13 <- subset(hs13, cells = cells_to_keep13)\n",
        "\n",
        "cells_to_keep254 <- sample(colnames(hs254), size = 1000)\n",
        "hs254 <- subset(hs254, cells = cells_to_keep254)\n",
        "\n",
        "cells_to_keep255 <- sample(colnames(hs255), size = 1000)\n",
        "hs255 <- subset(hs255, cells = cells_to_keep255)\n",
        "\n",
        "cells_to_keep266 <- sample(colnames(hs266), size = 1000)\n",
        "hs266 <- subset(hs266, cells = cells_to_keep266)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "TplVLqAM5b3K"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
