      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#10-4. Finding differentially expressed genes cluster2(presumably adipocyte) vs other clusters.\n",
        "\n",
        "This step was performed prior to the exercise due to time limit. Please refer to cluster2_markers file on github.\n",
        "\n",
        "%%R\n",
        "\n",
        "data <- JoinLayers(data)\n",
        "\n",
        "cluster2_markers <- FindMarkers(data,ident.1=2)\n",
        "\n",
        "cluster2_markers %>% dplyr::filter(avg_log2FC > 1)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "QHYxtlv-hv7O"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**avg_log2FC** represents the magnitude of the difference in the mean expression levels between the target cluster and the background\n",
        "\n",
        "pct.1 = 0.923 (**Sensitivity**): You can be 92.3% confident that if you pick a random cell from this cluster, it will express PLIN1, confirming it is a core feature of the group.\n",
        "\n",
        "pct.2 = 0.07 (**Specificity**): This gene is \"quiet\" in the rest of the tissue"
      ],
